YANI: Divining rod

Can be created randomly, or left behind by felled/kicked trees or
ex-wood golems.

Simply wield the divining rod and it will guide you to the nearest
fountain, sink, moat, pool, rust-trap or water elemental on the level
with messages like "The divining rod pulls north" etc.

If cursed, you can't un-wield it, and that sucks because it really
does make a useless weapon.

If blessed, you get a clairvoyant view of any nearby water sources. 

Not the most useful of items, but it might be handy for spotting traps
and it certainly would be fun.

If you wield one while polymorphed into certain firey monsters
(balrog, slashem's fire vampires or flame mages, I'm sure there are
loads of others) then it will seek out lava, fire traps and so on.

